stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open: begin at a snapshot, owned by one core
    Open --> Open: reads see own writes and merges in operation order
    Open --> Open: put, delete, merge, append are buffered
    Open --> Open: savepoint, rollback to savepoint
    Open --> RolledBack: rollback or drop
    Open --> Validating: commit or commit_nowait

    Validating --> WriteFree: wrote nothing, every read at the snapshot
    WriteFree --> Done: no validation, no critical section

    Validating --> Conflicted: a key lost its race
    Validating --> Decided: every key accepted

    Decided --> Written: WAL write, positions and allocations assigned
    Written --> Durable: fsync, a unit on the committer's IoQueue, or a blocking commit
    Durable --> Visible: published in sequence order
    Visible --> Done: receipt with seq, completion on the committer's own queue

    Conflicted --> Retrying: transact hands the reason to the re-run
    Retrying --> Open: a fresh transaction at a new snapshot
    Conflicted --> Failed: business logic stops, or attempts run out

    RolledBack --> [*]
    Done --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
